WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.323
A gastric ultrasound, against the clock.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.461
Machine on · abdominal preset · curved probe · gel

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.621
Semi-recumbent. Probe in the epigastrium, sagittal, marker to the head.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.416
Sweep until the liver edge, the antrum and the aorta are in one picture.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:02.608
Empty, clear fluid or solid? Here the antrum is flat: it looks empty.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.221
Turn the patient onto the right side.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:41.151
Fluid now fills the antrum. Empty supine, fluid right lateral: grade 1.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:02.959
Freeze between contractions. Trace the serosa. Three readings.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:26.095
Mean area 8.0 cm² → 73 mL → 0.98 mL/kg

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:45.339
2 min 30 s. Clear fluid below 1.5 mL/kg: consistent with a fasted stomach.
